 bar, picker caption plate
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Fixes from the 2026-09-30 manual test pass (HANDOFF A2, A3, A7, B10, B12),
decided as UX and recorded in ux/mobile-first-layout.md (D51-D54, §3.3,
§5.1.1, §5.8.1, §5.9), ux/ftue.md rev 5 and ux/rtl-map.md §2/§4.3/§8.6.

- A2: card 1 (dim) over the teaser rows and Row A are up from the pick;
  the plaza is one 84-px strip in the free ticker slot until H1.
- A7/B10: Row A's right end shows the round's leader (a 64-logical
  pick-avatar medallion at whole device px + the short name); the
  round-start name toast over the stage is gone. The name yields to the
  Cottage Index once the round has started, and the cup moves one slot
  left. Mute and settings work before tap 1.
- B12: the pre-tap undo chip sits centred in a full-bleed navy bar in the
  ticker slot; after an election it stays in the lane.
- A3: the picker's caption sits on a full-bleed navy plate (11.8:1).

Checks: test_pretap_hud.gd (9), mobile_web S13-S16, window.odDev.hud,
tools/web/pretap_shots.mjs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UJWVH11egMQ4r4GfyoMb4p
